---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Laboratório & Consultoria | Blockchain Dev Lab"
  description="Da ideia à implementação: projetos práticos de blockchain e consultoria especializada para empresas."
>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="py-16 md:py-24 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6">
        Da ideia à implementação
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-400 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Laboratório para desenvolvedores e consultoria para empresas.
        Blockchain do jeito certo.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Two Main Cards -->
    <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto mb-24">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <!-- Laboratório -->
        <div class="border-2 border-gray-800 hover:border-purple-500 transition-all rounded-lg p-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500/5 to-purple-500/10">
          <div class="text-5xl mb-6">🔬</div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">LABORATÓRIO</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            Projetos práticos, open-source e desenvolvimento real.
            Aprenda fazendo, construa seu portfolio, contribua para a comunidade.
          </p>
          
          <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8 text-sm">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              <span>Projetos guiados do iniciante ao avançado</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              <span>DeFi, NFTs, DAOs e infraestrutura</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              <span>Código aberto e colaborativo</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              <span>Mentoria técnica especializada</span>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <a
            href="/laboratorio-consultoria/laboratorios/iniciantes/"
            class="block w-full px-6 py-4 rounded-lg bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 transition-colors text-center font-medium text-lg text-white"
          >
            EXPLORAR PROJETOS
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Consultoria -->
        <div class="border-2 border-gray-800 hover:border-orange-500 transition-all rounded-lg p-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-500/5 to-orange-500/10">
          <div class="text-5xl mb-6">💼</div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">CONSULTORIA</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            Soluções blockchain para empresas, startups e instituições.
            Da arquitetura ao deploy, com segurança e qualidade.
          </p>
          
          <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8 text-sm">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-orange-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              <span>Arquitetura de soluções escaláveis</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-orange-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              <span>Desenvolvimento de smart contracts</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-orange-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              <span>Auditoria técnica e segurança</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-orange-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
              </svg>
              <span>Implementação end-to-end</span>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <a
            href="/laboratorio-consultoria/consultoria/briefing/"
            class="block w-full px-6 py-4 rounded-lg bg-orange-500 hover:bg-orange-600 transition-colors text-center font-medium text-lg text-white"
          >
            SOLICITAR ORÇAMENTO
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Stats Section -->
    <section class="py-16 border-t border-gray-800">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 text-center">
        <div>
          <div class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-2">200+</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-400">Projetos open source</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-2">50+</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-400">Empresas atendidas</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-2">1.200+</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-400">Desenvolvedores</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-2">R$ 80M+</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-400">Em contratos auditados</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Tech Stack -->
    <section class="py-16 border-t border-gray-800">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-4">
        Tecnologias que dominamos
      </h2>
      <p class="text-center text-gray-400 mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Stack completo para desenvolvimento blockchain profissional
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        {['Solidity', 'Ethereum', 'Polygon', 'Arbitrum', 'Hardhat', 'Foundry', 'The Graph', 'IPFS', 'Web3.js', 'Ethers.js', 'React', 'Next.js'].map((tech) => (
          <span class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-gray-800 hover:border-orange-500 transition-colors">
            {tech}
          </span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Process -->
    <section class="py-16 border-t border-gray-800">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-12">
        Nossa abordagem
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-5 gap-6">
        {[
          { number: '01', title: 'Descoberta', desc: 'Entendemos o desafio' },
          { number: '02', title: 'Arquitetura', desc: 'Desenhamos a solução' },
          { number: '03', title: 'Desenvolvimento', desc: 'Implementamos com qualidade' },
          { number: '04', title: 'Auditoria', desc: 'Garantimos segurança' },
          { number: '05', title: 'Deploy', desc: 'Colocamos em produção' },
        ].map((step) => (
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-orange-500/20 mb-3">{step.number}</div>
            <div class="font-bold mb-2">{step.title}</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-gray-400">{step.desc}</div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Final CTA -->
    <section class="py-16 border-t border-gray-800 mb-16">
      <div class="border border-gray-800 rounded-lg p-8 md:p-12 text-center bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-500/10 to-orange-500/5">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">
          Vamos construir juntos?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Seja para aprender com projetos práticos ou implementar soluções empresariais,
          estamos prontos para ajudar.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
          <a
            href="/laboratorio-consultoria/laboratorios/iniciantes/"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-lg border-2 border-purple-600 text-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-600 hover:text-white transition-all font-medium text-lg"
          >
            Ver Projetos
          </a>
          <a
            href="/laboratorio-consultoria/consultoria/briefing/"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-lg bg-orange-500 hover:bg-orange-600 transition-colors font-medium text-lg text-white"
          >
            Falar com Consultor
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
